OL,3,GNEWSA'Baby loss leave is welcome, but
OL,4,Amore can be done'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government announced on Tuesday
OL,7,Fthat from next April expectant parents
OL,8,Fwho lose a pregnancy before 24 weeks
OL,9,Fwill be entitled to up to two weeks'
OL,10,Funpaid leave.
OL,12,FSamantha said: "Any change is positive,
OL,13,Fbecause it means we're moving forward
OL,14,Fand loss is becoming less of a taboo
OL,15,Fsubject."
